sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Client as Client (HTTP / Admin UI)
    participant Router as FastAPI Router (api/v1/reports)
    participant Auth as RoleChecker (RBAC: administrador)
    participant Service as DailyInventoryBalanceReportService
    participant Port as DailyInventoryBalanceReportRepositoryPort (ABC)
    participant Repo as SQLAlchemyDailyInventoryBalanceReportRepository
    participant DB_Analytics as db_analytics (MariaDB)
    participant Domain as Domain (DailyInventoryBalanceRecord / Summary)

    Client->>Router: GET /api/v1/reports/inventory-balance?start_date=2026-09-01&end_date=2026-09-10
    Router->>Auth: Depends(require_admin) - Validate JWT token & role
    Auth-->>Router: Authorized claims (tenant_id="1", role="administrador")

    Router->>Router: Validate start_date <= end_date & build DailyInventoryBalanceFilters(start_date, end_date, branch_id=None)

    Router->>Service: get_daily_inventory_balance_report(tenant_id="1", filters)
    Service->>Port: fetch_daily_balance_records(tenant_id=1, start_date, end_date, branch_id=None)
    Port->>Repo: Delegate fetch_daily_balance_records(...)

    Repo->>DB_Analytics: SELECT * FROM daily_reports WHERE tenant_id = :tenant_id AND report_date >= :start_date AND report_date <= :end_date ORDER BY report_date ASC, branch_id ASC

    alt Pre-aggregated DailyReport ORM records exist
        DB_Analytics-->>Repo: List of DailyReport ORM instances
        Repo-->>Service: List[DailyInventoryBalanceRecord]
    else Fallback dynamic aggregation from AuditRecord ORM
        DB_Analytics-->>Repo: Empty result set (no DailyReport rows)
        Repo->>DB_Analytics: SELECT * FROM audit_records WHERE tenant_id = :tenant_id AND scan_timestamp >= :start_dt AND scan_timestamp <= :end_dt ORDER BY scan_timestamp ASC
        DB_Analytics-->>Repo: List of AuditRecord ORM instances
        Repo->>Repo: Group by (rec_date, rec_branch), sum additions/shrinkage units & values, compute net_variation = addition_value - shrinkage_value
        Repo-->>Service: List[DailyInventoryBalanceRecord]
    end

    Service->>Domain: Aggregate totals across records (sum total_addition_value, total_shrinkage_value, net_patrimonial_variation)
    Domain-->>Service: List[DailyInventoryBalanceSummary] & overall metrics

    Service-->>Router: DailyInventoryBalanceResponse DTO
    Router-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK (JSON Response with daily_summaries, net_patrimonial_variation, total_addition_value, total_shrinkage_value)
